<mxCell id="note_0" value="Browser = RegisterPage + LoginPage + frontend authService + Axios. Public RegisterPage sends CUSTOMER; backend also handles COLLABORATOR and SHOP_MANAGER requests. Global DTO validation runs before controller methods." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="2707" width="3360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note_1" value="OTP verifies registration email, not a second login factor. It is held in a per-process Map for 5 minutes, removed after 5 wrong guesses or successful assertion. Resend replaces the cached code; the 60-second resend countdown is enforced by UI." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="2757" width="3360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note_2" value="Expanded happy path is CUSTOMER. KOL requests create profile/tier lookup and Wallet; Shop requests create an inactive DRAFT Store while the User starts as CUSTOMER. These are separate writes, not a registration transaction; OTP is already consumed." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="2812" width="3360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note_3" value="MailService encapsulates Nodemailer SMTP. Missing configuration or ordinary send failure can fall back to console; success response is not proof of inbox delivery. Login alert is unawaited and never a blocking OTP challenge. No real email was sent for this diagram." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="2867" width="3360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note_4" value="Existing-account login also accepts a uniquely resolved Vietnamese phone number. Invalid credentials: 401; disabled account: 403; invalid/expired OTP or DTO: 400; duplicate email: 409. JWT_SECRET is required; no refresh-token flow or login 2FA endpoint exists in the inspected auth code." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="2922" width="3360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note_5" value="Protected routes use JwtAuthGuard + JwtStrategy to verify Bearer signature/expiry and reload active User; GET /api/auth/me returns safe account data. Those later calls, Google OAuth and password recovery are documented separately. Auto-login failure after registration returns UI to /login." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="2977" width="3360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>